<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on SGS Surveillance.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on SGS Surveillance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued four million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of SGS Societe Generale de Surveillance, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p> One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,300 CHF		 PREMIUM	13.82 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.65 CHF		  GEARING	8.82 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.FEB.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	05.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,220 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
